\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他完全躺在垫子上</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">正しい</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ただしい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">い形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">い形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">正确；对的；正当；正义；诚实；真实；合法</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"218865\">これが<ruby>正<rp>(</rp><rt>ただ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しいかどうか<ruby>自信<rp>(</rp><rt>じしん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がないんだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我不肯定这是不是对的。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/346201\" title=\"Tatoeba · nickyeow\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · nickyeow\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">建てる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">たてる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">建造；构建</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"221630\">この<ruby>寺院<rp>(</rp><rt>じいん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は７８０<ruby>年<rp>(</rp><rt>ねん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>建<rp>(</rp><rt>た</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>てられた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这座寺庙可追溯到780年</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">立てる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">たてる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">竖起；立起；树立；搭建；架设；刺入；戳入；埋入；挖入；发出；制造；引起；扬起；建立；制定；创建；拟定；形成；推举；提名；树立为领导；尊重；礼遇；给予应有地位；维护体面；磨快；使清晰；关闭；闭合；合上；点茶；进行茶道；除以；用力地…；尽力地…</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"143888\"><ruby>図書館<rp>(</rp><rt>としょかん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>では<ruby>物音<rp>(</rp><rt>ものおと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>立<rp>(</rp><rt>た</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ててはいけない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">别在图书馆里发出噪音</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">例えば</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">たとえば</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">例如；比如；譬如</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"77709\"><ruby>例<rp>(</rp><rt>たと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えば、ロンドンは<ruby>今<rp>(</rp><rt>いま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>朝<rp>(</rp><rt>あさ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>７<ruby>時<rp>(</rp><rt>じ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>です。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">例如,现在是伦敦上午7点。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">棚</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">たな</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">架子；搁板；货架；棚架；格架</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"84502\"><ruby>父<rp>(</rp><rt>ちち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>棚<rp>(</rp><rt>たな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>作<rp>(</rp><rt>つく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ってくれた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我父亲为我做了个架子</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">楽しみ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">たのしみ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">享受；快乐；娱乐；乐趣；消遣；爱好；期待；盼望；令人期待的事物</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">楽しむ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">たのしむ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">享受；获得乐趣；玩得开心；消遣；期待；期盼</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"146622\"><ruby>少年<rp>(</rp><rt>しょうねん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>たちはみなスキーを<ruby>楽<rp>(</rp><rt>たの</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しんだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">所有男孩都喜欢滑雪。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">たまに</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">偶尔</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\">たまに<ruby>一人<rp>(</rp><rt>ひとり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>旅行<rp>(</rp><rt>りょこう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>行<rp>(</rp><rt>い</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>く。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">偶尔一个人去旅行。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">為</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ため</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">好处；利益；福利；目的；缘故；为了……起见；结果；后果；影响；关于；针对；涉及</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"205610\">それは、おまえの<ruby>声<rp>(</rp><rt>こえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をよく<ruby>聞<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>くためだよ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">是为了听清楚你的声音</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">足りる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">たりる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">足够；充足；值得；配得上；堪称；胜任；应付；满足需要</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"172932\"><ruby>今<rp>(</rp><rt>いま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>、ちょっとお<ruby>金<rp>(</rp><rt>かね</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>足<rp>(</rp><rt>た</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>りなくてね。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我现在有点缺钱了</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">大学生</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">だいがくせい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/kanji/\">N5</a><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a><span class=\"v-m\">大学生</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span class=\"lx-src\"><span class=\"t-zh\">汉字 </span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">漢字 </span><a href=\"../../n5/kanji/\" lang=\"ja\">学</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">大事</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">だいじ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a><span class=\"v-m\">重要</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span class=\"lx-src\"><span class=\"t-zh\">汉字 </span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">漢字 </span><a href=\"../../n4/kanji/\" lang=\"ja\">事</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">大体</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">だいたい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">大体上；总的来说；大致；基本上；大约；左右；大致的；粗略的；概要；要点；梗概；主旨；实质；本来；首先；从一开始；原本</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"204724\">それらはだいたい<ruby>同<rp>(</rp><rt>おな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>じくらいの<ruby>大<rp>(</rp><rt>おお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きさだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">它们或多或少大小相同。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">大分</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">だいぶ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">相当地；很；大量地</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"203904\">だいぶ<ruby>痛<rp>(</rp><rt>いた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>みがなくなりました。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">痛苦大部分已经消失。</span></div></li>"]